== Spawning ==
'''Pests''' are able to spawn on {{Zone|The Garden}} in a few ways starting at {{Skill|Garden|5}}.

=== Farming ===
'''Pests''' are able to spawn while a [[Player]] is actively farming. '''Pests''' have a base {{Chance|0.2%|1|500}} chance to spawn per crop broken while off cooldown. The chance can be increased by up to {{Green|200%}} using {{Item|Salty Sprayonator}}, and {{Green|18%}} using the {{Item|Atmospheric Filter}} during Autumn with {{Attr|Filter Upgrade|X}}, making the highest possible chance {{Chance|0.636%|1|157.23}} during Autumn or {{Chance|0.6%|1|166.67}} outside of Autumn.{{confirm}}

'''Pests''' may spawn in the plot the player is farming in or in any of the {{Green|4}} adjacent plots, including default plots and [[Greenhouse]] plots, but excluding locked plots, void plots, and the Barn plot. Offline Pests can still spawn on the Barn plot with the use of [[Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination]].

==== Bonus Pest Chance ====
{{Main|Bonus Pest Chance}}
By default, only one '''Pest''' will spawn at a time. This can be increased via {{Stat|Bonus Pest Chance}}.

==== Spawn Cooldown ====
After '''Pests''' spawn, spawning goes on cooldown for a base {{Green|5 minutes}}. The cooldown can be modified from a few sources. All percentage modifiers stack additively.
