By default, each '''Pest''' has a weight of {{Green|100}}, meaning they have an equal chance to be chosen whenever one spawns. The weights for specific pests can be modified in several ways.<ref>{{Cite Discord|staff=y|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1530260886902800404|user=mrkeith|date=7/24/26, 1:10 PM (EST)|text=as follows:
