=== Offline ===
While no players are present and the {{Zone|The Garden}} is unloaded, Offline '''Pests''' are able to spawn at a rate of {{Green|1}} '''Pest''' per {{Green|1 Hour}}.

==== Disco ====
{{Main|Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination}}
{{Item|Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination}} can be placed on {{zone|The Garden}} to force all offline '''Pests''' to spawn within {{Green|10}} blocks of it. It requires each '''Pest's''' corresponding [[Pest Vinyl]] to attract it. Only one {{Item|Buzzybee's Fantabulous Disco Destination}} can be placed at a time.

=== Traps ===
{{Main|Pest Trap|Mouse Trap|Vermin Trap}}
If the player has {{Item|Pest Trap}}s, {{Item|Mouse Trap}}s, or {{Item|Vermin Trap}}s placed down with [[Sprayonator]] material inside, '''Pests''' can spawn in them. Each '''Pest''' that spawns in a trap consumes {{Green|1}} [[Sprayonator]] material. Whether the player is online or offline, the spawn rate is about {{Green|1}} Pest per {{Green|15 Minutes}}.

==== Field Mouse ====
{{Main|Field Mouse}}
A {{MobSprite|Field Mouse}} can spawn in a {{Item|Pest Trap}} with a base chance of {{Chance|2.78%|1|36}}, a {{Item|Mouse Trap}} with a base chance of {{Chance|7.89%|1|12.67}}, or a {{Item|Vermin Trap}} with a base chance of {{Chance|10.26%|1|9.75}}. The chance for a '''Field Mouse''' is also affected by {{Stat|Tracking}}.

==== Lunar Moth ====
{{Main|Lunar Moth}}
A {{MobSprite|Lunar Moth}} is guaranteed to spawn in any trap with {{Item|Moondew}}.

== Behavior ==
Most pests will attempt to flee from the player, but they also try to stay in the plot they spawned in, with the exception of the {{MobSprite|Earthworm}} '''pest''' who will not try to flee from the player.

When {{Green|4}} or more '''Pests''' are on {{Zone|The Garden}} at once, the player's {{Stat|Farming Fortune}} (as well as each crop-specific fortune stat) is reduced, first by {{Green|5%}} and then multiples of {{Green|15%}}. {{Stat|Farming Fortune}} will continue to be lost for each additional '''Pest''', up to {{Green|8}}, after which no more '''Pests''' will spawn until at least one is killed. The maximum {{Stat|Farming Fortune}} loss is {{Green|75%}}.

For each {{Stat|Bonus Pest Chance|100}} the player has, they can have {{Green|1}} more '''Pest''' on their Garden before their {{Stat|Farming Fortune}} starts being reduced. The reduction then starts at {{Green|5%}} and scales from there.

