{{Main|Pesthunter Phillip}}
'''{{Pests}}''' can be exchanged at {{NPCSprite|Pesthunter Phillip}} to gain temporary {{statname|Farming Fortune|5}} for {{Green|30 minutes}} per consumed '''{{Dark Green|Pest}}''', up to 40 '''{{Pests}}'''. They can also be exchanged for various items in {{NPCSprite|Pesthunter Phillip}}'s shop.

