Killing a '''Pest''' also rewards the player with {{Bits|5}}, multiplied by their [[Fame Ranks|Bits Multiplier]].

=== Rare Drops ===
All non-guaranteed '''Pest''' drops have their drop rate increased by {{Stat|Overbloom}}.

The formula for drop chance for rare drops is:

<math>\text{Drop Chance} = \text{Base Drop Chance} \times \left(1 + \frac{\text{Overbloom}}{100}\right)</math>

For pet drops ({{Item|Rat Pet}} and {{Item|Slug Pet}}), the formula also includes {{stat|Pet Luck}}:<ref>{{Cite Discord|staff=y|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1538969752037494875|user=mrkeith|date=8/17/26, 2:12 PM (EST)|text=<pre>Is pet luck included in the formula? Before the Overbloom change pet luck affected Rat and Slug pets drop rates at 1/6 of normal rates. Is it changed now, or is it still affected by it?</pre>

Yes looks like it}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Discord|staff=y|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1538981264797728888|user=mrkeith|date=8/17/26, 2:42 PM (EST)|text=<pre>i am assuming it's 1+(Pet Luck/600) still then because based on testing it seemed impossible that it's 1+(Pet Luck/100)</pre>

this is correct}}</ref>

<math>\text{Drop Chance} = \text{Base Drop Chance} \times \left(1 + \frac{\text{Overbloom}}{100} + \frac{\text{Pet Luck}}{600}\right)</math>

All '''Pests''' can drop their respective Feast '''RARE CROP''' if it is in-season. Field Mice have a 30% chance to drop one of the in-season crop's RARE CROP at random.

